  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Monitoring, Learning and Evaluation: Third Party Monitoring of selected FCDO- Funded Emergency programmes.</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">IMPACT Initiatives will continue conducting Third Party Monitoring of selected FCDO-funded emergency programmes in DRC in order to support the quality, efficiency, accountability and aid integrity of emergency programmes in DRC while providing a critical support to humanitarian coordination in DRC through it REACH initiative.</narrative>
  </description>
